qa/s13/

# Raw staff-photo intake (S14) — originals stay local; the optimized webp
# pipeline output in public/staff/ is what ships and is committed.
incoming-staff-photos/
public/videos/_originals/
# S38: same rule for the live intake folder the director drops photos into —
# full-res headshots + raw classroom shots (~41 MB). It is also in
# NEVER_PUBLISH (vite.config.js) so it never reaches the CDN. Picks that go
# live are re-cut into tracked paths: public/staff/ and public/images/sessions/.
public/staff/incoming/
# S38l: video intake. Finals are re-encoded into public/videos/<slug>.mp4 and
# committed; raw camera masters and anything dropped here stay local, exactly
# like videos/_originals above. Also in NEVER_PUBLISH (vite.config.js).
public/videos/_incoming/
